        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi gwayiida buuneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiinaada shataani aba badayda fuga Israeli, ak ghwanung' gwayiida Dawdi fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Yoabu sea shirikareeda hees ambal lugooda, “Aweayeena ak gooyiidayi fuga Israeli, ghang'eada Beer-sheba ea ghwahiita Dani, ak gooyeanean iita, ak ghaanali mooneeda nyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Yoabu, “Gidabal ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA ghoahaada fugaaschi niba bughala aba mooneeda nyaawa bea ghamneawa! Neada ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda, fiisu seaniin ea mii fuga gadiyeeda ng'utamiideanyu? Abeeda ghwasaan inyas gagasa ng'utamiideanyu ng'asheanji? Ghwasaan inyas gaygweadu munyinda badayda Israeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwajoar ng'asheanda sugoocheanda Yoabu. Hean gawa Yoabu ak gwasik bugusta Israeleesean, ak gabiigu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadayda Yoabu mooneeda buuneeda aba heeda Dawdi. Nea mooneeda buuneesean bea Israeli ea sagalama niba sagalama ea sagalamnyooji bughala mideawa ng'utkeaka, ea fuga Yuda sagalamnyooji bughalaji ang'wan ea laadam ea damanamughuush mideawa ng'utkeaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea meaguuyi sea fuga Lawi ea Benjamini aba iitooda, aba gideaba ng'asheanda sugoocheanda niinyareas Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadu gamunyiit ng'asheanji aba madeeda ASEETA, ak ghwalas fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha ASEETA, “Aniini neasinyi riing'eeda haw ak geasinyi ng'asheanji. Ak ghamneawa geamuscheey ang'iing'i, geanda munyinda siidaang'u bea gadiyeeda; aba gideaba neasinyi leendeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobalool NG'UTAMIIDA Gadi, was siida ng'ushta bea Dawdi, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Una ak giyeeshi Dawdi, ‘Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Geagoonyeey ng'asha samwagu; loada akaleala aba jeeda, ak abeeda geasinneey’.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwaan Gadi heeda Dawdi ak gwayeesha niny, “Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Geanda gidigasayi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghana gweanyeew samwagu bea geejeeda; ghana sheeh samwagu bea sawanadeeda aba heeda weajoodigaagu, nea ghwanyasnyi ng'uta fuga sinyi; ghana eawooji samwagu bea ng'uta NG'UTAMIIDA, dawni aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, nea gwanyarja malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA moonghajeega sean bea Israeli?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha Gadi, “Aniini geandi jeeda sawanadeeda haw; ghang'wana geabisi geatinga NG'UTAMIIDA, aba gideaba inyeanda jeadaanyi aahaw muuchi; adiidu geabisi geatinga siida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweadu NG'UTAMIIDA dawni badayda Israeli ak gameewa fih sagalamnyooji laadam ea damanamughuush was headiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goojeagu ASEETA malaykajeanda ghwaan gwanyarja Yerusalemu; hean nea ghwariikghta gwanyarja, ghwadaah NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwaduukuuna riing'eeda; ak ghwayam fughareadaanyi ak gwayeesha malaykajeanda hidu gwanyarja, “Nihit; reekusiina geatindaang'u.” Hean ghamiinaada malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA aba murdeeda bugharjeanda siileela booga bea Arauna bea eemeeda Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gagatkat Dawdi gheanyangaaschi, ak ghwadaah malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea ghamiinaada aba dageascheeda ng'eanyiida ea dea humng'eeda, nea gwandeawa ng'uta sifagu aba geatindaanyi, nea geekeal Yerusalemu. Hean ghoabeada Dawdi sea gweargwa ea ghabwada jeesinga ng'eanyi, nea niikwa hang'weaka guniyajeega aba giiseaneega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Dawdi ak gwayeesha ASEETA, “Neada ea mii aniini siida nung' eeyiida buuneeda? Aniini gil siida sin riing'eeda ak gwasin ng'asheega munyas. Duuku gisilsu, neada ea nisin naaha? Geamuscheey nung' ghwaan geatindaang'u badaydeanyu Ea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYU, ea badayda fuga ghaheanya; ak ea adinung' ghwaan dawni badahuuka fugaagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA Gadi eeshiina Dawdi gideaba dawa Dawdi ghwascheang'da ak gwasin heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA aba bugharjeanda siileela booga bea Ornani mida Yebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwascheang'da Dawdi ak gawa aba ng'asheanda Gadi, ghayi rugu aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Ornani ghoaleal ngaano; ak ghwasach ghaat ak ghwadaah malaykajeanda, nea orjoagaaschi asang'wan mideawa ghafuy geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaan Dawdi heeda Ornani, ak ghoang'wearda Ornani ak ghwadaah Dawdi ak ghabeawa heeda bugharjeanda siileela booga, ak gwasissa mureeda Dawdi nea ghang'uda gheamamdaanyi ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Dawdi Ornani, “Goonean bugharjeanda siileela booga dadeeksa heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA goonean aba sheayeeda miy ak abeeda geasaja dawni jeeda buuneeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwalamda Ornani ak gwayeesha Dawdi, “Geanda, ak abeeda gwasin ng'utamiideanyu was sugoocheanda gidadaah gideaba aamiy aba headaanyi; ng'ula, geagoonyi heewga ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda, nea bayiiga sibwara booga ghoah ghweenga, nea ngaano ghoah haleanjeeda ghadooweeda was dearanga. Geagoonyi sean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda sugoocheanda was Dawdi ak gwayeesha Ornani, “Manda, gaydasha aba sheayeeda miy; aniini maydaadaw NG'UTAMIIDA gidawas daang'u, ghana daadayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda maydaadayda gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw Dawdi Ornani shekeelaji bughalaji lah bea dahaabu iisiiteen aba sheayda bugharjeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwadeeksa Dawdi hoowa heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghoadayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo, ak gaguursa gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwashaaha NG'UTAMIIDA beasta abina humng'eeda abissa heeda wagiida ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA malaykajeanda; ak goodeelsa ng'utaanyi jeeda labaldaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damandida, iidaah Dawdi gideaba nisha NG'UTAMIIDA ghuutaanyi aba bugharjeanda siileela booga bea Ornani bea eemeeda Yebusi, gwasin lukghumajeagaaschi aba hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba heeda ghaydit bea NG'UTAMIIDA, ghayi sin Musa aba dareapcheeda, ea heeda wagiida sigwariideaysa haleanjeeda ghadooweeda gwanda damandida heetiyeada aba Gibeoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea mawa Dawdi madeadaanyi ghoanyaash ASEETA; aba gideaba ghoawal ng'eang'i aba ng'uta malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
